+    This is the version of the DECstation 5000/200 (KN02, MIPS R3000). The
+    KN02 has no system DMA controller and no map registers: the SCSI
+    controller of the system module moves the data of a transfer to and
+    from a 128kb buffer on the module, which the processor copies to and
+    from memory, and a bus master of a TURBOchannel slot addresses memory
+    with physical addresses.
=1 14 16
